## after a crash
tone: Warning
--- discord ---
### 🚀 Quack is up
`0.1.0` · ready in **7 seconds** · **1** migration · **1,204** servers
⚠️ The run before ended without stopping (a crash or a kill). It was last seen <t:1794924309:R>, so Quack was down for about **1 day 1 hour**.
